Workshop on Big Data Systems and Technologies ? BDST
Big Data is transforming the way we think about Computing and Informat=
ion Systems. It influences science, engineering, medicine, healthcare,=
 finance, business, and all of the society itself. This workshop provi=
des a leading forum for disseminating the latest research in Big Data =
Research, Development, and Applications, as well as how Big Data chang=
es the way we create, deploy and use Information Systems. We solicit h=
igh-quality original research papers (including significant work-in-pr=
ogress) in any aspect of Big Data with emphasis on 5Vs (Volume, Veloci=
ty, Variety, Value and Veracity): big data science and foundations, bi=
g data infrastructure, big data management, big data searching and min=
ing, big data privacy/security, and big data applications.
